## Solution
```java
class Solution {
    public int countDistinctSubstring(String s) {
        Node root = new Node();
        int cnt=0;
        for(int i=0; i<s.length(); i++){
            Node node = root;
            for(int j=i; j<s.length(); j++){
                if(!node.containsNode(s.charAt(j))){
                    node.addNode(s.charAt(j), new Node());
                    cnt++;
                }
                node = node.getNode(s.charAt(j));
            }
        }
        return cnt+1;
    }
}

class Node{
    private Node[] trie = new Node[26];

    Node getNode(char c){
        return trie[c - 'a'];
    }

    void addNode(char c, Node node){
        trie[c-'a'] = node;
    }

    boolean containsNode(char c){
        return trie[c-'a'] != null;
    }
}
```

